                "text": "Delivering these results is why I fought to include my Reduced Costs and Continued Cures Act in the IRA.\n\nThe list includes lifesaving medicines for diabetes, cancer, and heart disease which cost Medicare patients $3.4B in out-of-pocket costs in 2022 alone.",
