                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Casework success! Elizabeth from Pacific Beach contacted my office after her husband Robert\u2019s Social Security benefits were inexplicably terminated. The loss of benefits \u2014 and of Robert\u2019s Medicare coverage \u2014 caused the couple significant financial and emotional distress. +",
