                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A member of my staff reached out to the Social Security Administration, which eventually determined that Robert\u2019s benefits were erroneously terminated and issued him a check immediately for $7,200 in to cover missed payments. Robert's Medicare coverage was also reinstated.",
