                "text": "Women should never face barriers when it comes to reproductive health care. Even in California, which has has taken steps to safeguard abortion rights, there might be confusion over insurance coverage or questions about what to do if a medical provider isn't following the law. My website now includes a comprehensive list of local, state, and federal resources about reproductive rights and how to access care. https://t.co/c7ALkiwEQ7",
